#: {{ux|sh|Voljeli '''bi''' jednog dana posjetiti Japan.|We/They would like to visit Japan one day.|inline=1}}

====Usage notes====
* In colloquial Serbo-Croatian, ''bi'' is commonly used in place of other aorist forms when forming conditional of ''biti'' in both singular and plural if the subject is deducible from context (usually from the conjugated form of the verb). That is, ''bi'' is a shared shorthand for {{m|sh|bih}}, {{m|sh|bismo}}, {{m|sh|biste}} and {{m|sh|biše}}.

